auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # personal-website-api

  Every request here targets `{{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}`. The prefix is a variable
  on purpose: it is one literal string in `api/app/core/config.py` (`API_PREFIX`)
  and changing it there means changing it here, in one place.

  Authenticated requests inherit the collection-level bearer token above, which
  reads `{{accessToken}}`. Run `Setup / Sign in and capture token` to fill it.
  Public requests set `auth: none` explicitly.

  See `README.md` next to this file for setup.
}
